<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Culture &amp; Lifestyle</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Germany</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-cul</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-cul" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/s-1441?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-cul" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Oktoberfest 2026: Everything you need to know</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:69b20e12676120e517102308454df48d55dd72692fdf62199209b53fa0283166</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T09:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/oktoberfest-2026-everything-you-need-to-know/a-79311285--1e3ee9d16248.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/oktoberfest-2026-everything-you-need-to-know/a-79311285?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">This year, AI will be used to manage overcrowded situations. Find all the numbers surrounding the fest — including the price of water!</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Oktoberfest opens as Munich mayor taps first beer keg</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fffd4fba51cb10d0665edaed829c2c3b70f4911819acbc506fefeebdb9c3905c</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T08:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/oktoberfest-opens-as-munich-mayor-taps-first-beer-keg/a-79336519--c14aa7f149ba.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/oktoberfest-opens-as-munich-mayor-taps-first-beer-keg/a-79336519?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Thousands of visitors streamed onto Munich's Oktoberfest grounds as the world-famous beer festival got underway. Some spent the night outside the gates to secure coveted places in the festival tents.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: Oktoberfest beer prices rise, outpacing inflation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8433bb17e458ed99e18e6fb249c61529d91639ac8d883d9a9c01fc19a3af90fc</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T18:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-oktoberfest-beer-prices-rise-outpacing-inflation/a-79296932--12fa98bb1113.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-oktoberfest-beer-prices-rise-outpacing-inflation/a-79296932?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Oktoberfest's traditional beer mug, the Mass, will cost an average of €15.61 ($18.50) at this year's festival in Munich.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ed Sheeran speaks on Gaza in concert after Macklemore controversy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:74164c07f9a1b596ce70f2a2a68bcf4b4d958dbb6de14ada4bba2c488aa7625e</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-20T08:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ed-sheeran-speaks-on-gaza-in-concert-after-macklemore-controversy/a-79341971--af13de157344.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ed-sheeran-speaks-on-gaza-in-concert-after-macklemore-controversy/a-79341971?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Sheeran called the Hamas-led attack in Israel "horrific" and described the war in Gaza as "catastrophic and unjustifiable" during his first concert since the Macklemore controversy erupted.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Rebels, workers, radicals: The making of 'Red Berlin'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5b9f8165590ae2a2c641ea7e2d27dee2c20f648fd778e0beea15efd7b5eb8143</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-19T09:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/rebels-workers-radicals-the-making-of-red-berlin/a-79325410--afcfe0d2ce3c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/rebels-workers-radicals-the-making-of-red-berlin/a-79325410?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bloody May, student sit-ins and the squatter movement: Berlin has long been a hotbed for working-class organizing and radical left-wing politics.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Beethoven and Andy Warhol: Rebel icons on show in Bonn</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a7599c34a92443615c667a304762143efa5cc4bff318bb9bf65498cba565eab8</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-18T12:57:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/beethoven-and-andy-warhol-rebel-icons-on-show-in-bonn/a-79296944--59ad6d6535a9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/beethoven-and-andy-warhol-rebel-icons-on-show-in-bonn/a-79296944?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The new exhibition "Beethoven by Warhol" at the Beethoven House in Bonn presents the pop artist's late masterpiece: a picture of Ludwig van Beethoven. The exhibition shares the story of the work with the public.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>German drama 'Blindspot Berlin' revisits 2016 Christmas market attack</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c437ac5b6ff356e1364e4f72e02d306d7c42ca8c159b3793c4ca2984b4331815</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T09:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-drama-blindspot-berlin-revisits-2016-christmas-market-attack/a-79281162--11e3e3b69ad1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-drama-blindspot-berlin-revisits-2016-christmas-market-attack/a-79281162?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A decade after the terrorist attack on a Berlin Christmas market, a new German miniseries looks into the institutional failures that allowed the deadly truck rampage to happen.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Saint, sinner or feminist icon: How Mary Magdalene's image evolved through time</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:61e304614d6ad16fb7ce5139cca65e6cd10d51ba1565dfb1a9a09dccd844d7c6</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T07:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saint-sinner-or-feminist-icon-how-mary-magdalene-s-image-evolved-through-time/a-79293868--1a6f3ade345e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saint-sinner-or-feminist-icon-how-mary-magdalene-s-image-evolved-through-time/a-79293868?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">From "Apostle of the Apostles" to prostitute, Mary Magdalene has been assigned a wide variety of roles, as a new exhibition shows.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>This extremely successful author polarizes German readers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ae1210e49270c6443f47d2f6eb7020abe60c30ab8dd1ec06f4c6aaf45ab8ee69</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T07:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452--1ca180b39c00.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">She's young and she says what she thinks: Caroline Wahl is topping Germany's bestseller lists with her novels. But she has also faced a public backlash.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Pay to ghost your boss: Japan's resignation business</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:dcb0f83845acf5a3d77e57853164a016ee2d9cea82e0e0f74b778b296e40a471</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T10:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pay-to-ghost-your-boss-japan-s-resignation-business/a-79213584--1937a091cd92.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pay-to-ghost-your-boss-japan-s-resignation-business/a-79213584?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Resignation agencies in Japan help employees leave their jobs seamlessly in just 15 minutes. Young people are especially eager to use their services.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Russians on the Goethe-Institut: 'Hostage to politics'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4f560cf7779b676b578cef21078c8d7802b74661885a9ad758460cb6d9adcf56</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T11:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russians-on-the-goethe-institut-hostage-to-politics/a-79218936--8619b68c7998.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russians-on-the-goethe-institut-hostage-to-politics/a-79218936?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Canceled language exams, disrupted plans to study in Germany and the disappearance of an important cultural link: DW users shared how the closure of Germany's Goethe-Institut in Russia has affected their lives.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>A Romani artist in Hungary reclaims his identity</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:866143f71a732e0cfdb8371dda765fb52221c7247ade5f2bd606b650345a9cbe</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T08:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/a-romani-artist-in-hungary-reclaims-his-identity/a-79247266--3fed9cef9147.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/a-romani-artist-in-hungary-reclaims-his-identity/a-79247266?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Norbert Olah is an artist. He's also Romani. For a long time, he avoided making his ethnic background a theme of his art for fear of being pigeonholed. Then it became his focus.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>The 'end of an era' as Goethe-Institut in Russia closes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5a88a3b7a725a2df42d1e7f7aaf1a25496246a9b035150131735cf1348726f0d</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T09:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-end-of-an-era-as-goethe-institut-in-russia-closes/a-79224321--189393464061.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-end-of-an-era-as-goethe-institut-in-russia-closes/a-79224321?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Goethe-Institut was one of the last German institutions still operating in Russia. However, following Moscow's decision to close its offices, all employees will have to stop working by September 13.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Dropouts plague Ed Sheeran tour over Macklemore ouster</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d4140e93ccd80b3b89b49903a2b7fb1c64bb6c32932f265d206460e33eb76896</id><updated>2026-09-22T05:10:12Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T00:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/dropouts-plague-ed-sheeran-tour-over-macklemore-ouster/a-79284880--9cb1a3316aaa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/dropouts-plague-ed-sheeran-tour-over-macklemore-ouster/a-79284880?maca=en-rss-en-cul-2090-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Macklemore was dropped over his pro-Palestinian stance, amid accusations of antisemitism. Sheeran said removing the artist was not his decision but that of the tour's promoters.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
